  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Technology Centre and Network (CTCN) is the UNs Framework Convention on Climate Change (UNFCCC) implementation mechanism to support capacity building and transfer of low carbon technologies to devloping countries in order to accelerate climate transition, meet global goals and strengthen SE strategic position in int&apos;l negotiations.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Climate Technology Centre and Network (CTCN) &#xe4;r FNs klimatkonventions genomf&#xf6;randemekanism f&#xf6;r fr&#xe4;mjande av teknik- och kunskaps&#xf6;verf&#xf6;ring till u-l&#xe4;nder f&#xf6;r att p&#xe5;skynda klimatomst&#xe4;llning, uppfylla de globala m&#xe5;len samt st&#xe4;rka SE strategiska st&#xe4;llning i int klimatf&#xf6;rhandlingar.</narrative>
  </description>
